    "body": "Can we consider this closed due to Reffy?\r\n\r\nThat also results in packages such as https://www.npmjs.com/package/@webref/elements. I would suggest we consider that the \"blessed\" way of obtaining this kind of data from the specification. (Though not normative.)\r\n\r\nPerhaps worth adding an FAQ entry as this question sometimes comes up? (E.g., https://twitter.com/mac_cain13/status/1621302289230188545.)",
